{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794312861303,"sessionID":"ses_e3ab6a190ffeefD3lk4C1wi2O7","part":{"id":"prt_1c5617673001J7pxedNclB1jLW","messageID":"msg_1c56139aa001QhGU4eqh5NCBDZ","sessionID":"ses_e3ab6a190ffeefD3lk4C1wi2O7","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794312916851,"sessionID":"ses_e3ab6a190ffeefD3lk4C1wi2O7","part":{"id":"prt_1c56176ba001FAHZZPG3FUkZ97","messageID":"msg_1c56139aa001QhGU4eqh5NCBDZ","sessionID":"ses_e3ab6a190ffeefD3lk4C1wi2O7","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a persistent URL shortener with a Flask JSON API, React/TypeScript frontend styled with Tailwind, and admin moderation.\n- Serve API, short-link redirects, and the built frontend from the same Dockerized server on port 8000; persist SQLite under `./data`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace: `/workspace`; original starter inspected, no `AGENTS.md`, initially clean Git status.\n- Required endpoints:\n  - `POST /api/auth/register`, `POST /api/auth/login`.\n  - `POST /api/links`, public paged `GET /api/links`, public `GET /api/links/{id}`, owner-only `DELETE /api/links/{id}`.\n  - Admin-only paged `GET /api/admin/links`, `POST /api/admin/links/{id}/toggle`.\n  - `GET /r/{code}`: 302, exact original destination, increment clicks; unknown/disabled links return 404, never frontend fallback.\n  - `GET /api/health`: `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`.\n- Bearer tokens required for protected operations. Reserved `admin` account uses only startup `ADMIN_PASSWORD`; unset/empty disables sign-in. No default admin password.\n- API link objects use `owner` as username, relative `short_url` `/r/<code>`, plus `is_active` for moderation.\n- SQLite database: `data/shortlinks.sqlite3`, WAL mode. Passwords and session tokens stored hashed; sessions expire after 30 days and survive restart. Admin password rotation/removal revokes admin sessions.\n- Additional frontend-support endpoints implemented: `/api/auth/me`, `/api/auth/logout`, `/api/links/mine`, `/api/stats`; optional `q` search on paged lists.\n- Frontend branded “Trim”; forest-green/cream dashboard, responsive sidebar, decorative SVG illustrations, authentic community-wide statistics; no seeded/fake links.\n- Only CSS file is Tailwind entry/theme definitions: `frontend/src/index.css`.\n- Python available as `python3` (3.13.5), not `python`; Node v24.22.1.\n- Default registries fail with 502/no matching distributions. Successful installs require:\n  - npm: `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org`\n  - pip: `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple`\n- Original pip `-r backend/requirements.txt -c backend/requirements.lock` fails because hashes in constraints activate hash mode without supplying requirement hashes. Docker now installs `backend/requirements.lock` directly; install `backend/requirements-dev.txt` separately.\n- Use `apply_patch` for source-file edits. No commits made.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Implemented complete Flask API in `backend/app.py` with `create_app(config=None)` and production `app = create_app()`.\n- Validation, JSON errors, pagination (default 10; allowed 1–100), newest-first ordering, owner deletion, moderation, safe frontend fallback, security/cache headers implemented.\n- Redirect click updates atomic (`UPDATE ... RETURNING`); HEAD redirects without incrementing; redirects use `Cache-Control: no-store`.\n- Implemented React dashboard:\n  - Registration/login dialogs, restored sessions, username/admin badge, accessible sign-out.\n  - Shorten form showing API validation and full short URL with copy.\n  - Recent/my/admin links, pagination, debounced search, refresh, click/date columns, truncated originals with hover title.\n  - Owner delete confirmation and admin disable/re-enable.\n  - Responsive mobile navigation, empty/loading/error states, notifications, help dialog.\n- Installed Tailwind Vite plugin, TypeScript, React types, ESLint tooling; added build/typecheck/lint scripts and favicon.\n- Added 18 backend unittest tests, all passing:\n  - Auth/validation/hashing, ownership, admin authorization, moderation, pagination, redirects/HEAD, concurrent clicks, token expiry/logout, restart persistence, admin rotation/removal, frontend routing, search/stats.\n- Latest passing backend command:\n  - `python3 -m unittest discover -s backend -p 'test_*.py' -v && python3 -m ruff check backend`\n  - 18 tests passed in ~20 seconds; Ruff check passed; previous resource warnings fixed.\n- Frontend build/lint/typecheck passed after `npm ci` and accessible sign-out fix:\n  - `npm run build && npm run lint && npm run typecheck`\n  - Latest successful build assets: `index-DdcvpI13.css`, `index-BXN6xbny.js`.\n- `git diff --check` previously clean.\n- Added README documenting startup, auth, data, API, verification; added ignore rules.\n- Added browser tests/config: 3 flows × desktop/mobile = 6 tests; isolated temporary SQLite test server on port 8001.\n\n### Active\n- Final todo remains “Add and run API tests, frontend build, lint, and type checks” in progress; other todos completed.\n- Investigating browser tests failing shortly after frontend assets load. All 6 browser tests currently fail; exact underlying errors were truncated in tool output and not yet inspected.\n- Last action: created temporary ignored diagnostic script `/workspace/frontend/.browser/smoke.mjs`; **not run yet**.\n  - Starts `python3 tests/server.py`.\n  - Launches Chromium using `@sparticuz/chromium` recommended `args`.\n  - Logs browser console/page errors/crashes, title/headings.\n  - Writes `/workspace/frontend/.browser/overview.png`.\n  - Closes browser/server in `finally`.\n- Added `@types/node` and expanded `frontend/tsconfig.json` includes to cover `playwright.config.ts` and `tests/*.ts`; rerun typecheck/build/lint after these latest additions.\n- Playwright initially installed latest 1.65.0; downgraded to `@playwright/test@1.56.1` while troubleshooting. Downgrade did not resolve failures.\n- Ruff formatting differs from current Python files (`python3 -m ruff format --diff backend` produced diff); format check removed from README. Ruff lint is passing.\n\n### Blocked\n- Normal `npx playwright install chromium` download blocked with HTTP 403 from `https://cdn.playwright.dev/builds/cft/158.0.8127.18/linux64/chrome-linux64.zip`.\n- Workaround installed `@sparticuz/chromium@153.0.0` locally under ignored `frontend/.browser/`, **not a production/project dependency**.\n  - Browser executable: `/workspace/frontend/.browser/chromium`.\n  - Extracted bundled missing libraries to `/workspace/frontend/.browser/al2023/lib`.\n  - Required environment:\n    `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/frontend/.browser/al2023/lib:/workspace/frontend/.browser`\n  - Browser `--version` succeeds: `Chromium 153.0.8010.0`.\n  - `/tmp/opencode` is root-owned/nonwritable; extraction there failed `EACCES`. Use `TMPDIR=/workspace/frontend/.browser`.\n- Browser test command launches Chromium successfully now but fails all flows:\n  `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/frontend/.browser/al2023/lib:/workspace/frontend/.browser PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/workspace/frontend/.browser/chromium npm run test:e2e`\n- Once `npm run build` produced `Illegal instruction (core dumped)` and subsequent direct run timed out after temporary no-save root install. `npm ci` reset dependencies and build/lint/typecheck then passed; temporary browser packages are now isolated.\n- Docker image build/runtime not yet verified.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run diagnostic from `/workspace/frontend`:\n   `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/frontend/.browser/al2023/lib:/workspace/frontend/.browser TMPDIR=/workspace/frontend/.browser node .browser/smoke.mjs`\n   Inspect errors/screenshot; compare recommended Chromium launch arguments against `playwright.config.ts`. Inspect detailed browser failure artifacts in `frontend/test-results/` or rerun one test with focused/untruncated output.\n2. Fix browser/runtime/test issues, rerun all 6 desktop/mobile flows and final backend/frontend checks. Confirm Docker startup if tooling exists, inspect final Git diff, update todo to completed, and give concise implementation/verification report.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: Flask app factory, SQLite schema, auth, all routes, frontend serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_app.py`: 18 passing unittest cases.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: unchanged pinned runtime dependencies/hashes.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements-dev.txt`: `ruff==0.17.4`.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: original multi-stage build; pip changed to direct lock-file installation.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: run/API/verification docs; browser tests serve existing `frontend/dist` (build before testing).\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: exclude data/build/dependencies/browser/test artifacts.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: dashboard and state/network/copy/delete/moderation logic.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/AuthDialog.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/Modal.tsx`: account forms/native accessible dialogs; modal width fixed to `w-[calc(100%_-_2rem)]`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: `api<T>`, `ApiError`, `Link`, `Page`, `Stats`, `User`, `fullShortUrl`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/Icon.tsx`: inline SVG icon component.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`, `/workspace/frontend/src/main.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/vite-env.d.ts`: Tailwind theme/entry and CSS type declarations.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: dependencies/scripts including `test:e2e`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/eslint.config.js`, `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: tooling; Vite proxies `/api` and `/r` to port 8000.\n- `/workspace/frontend/playwright.config.ts`: desktop/mobile projects, single worker, custom executable env support, temporary test server.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tests/app.spec.ts`: browser flows for register/validate/copy/click/delete/login, my-link paging/search, admin toggle.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tests/server.py`: temporary SQLite Flask server on `127.0.0.1:8001`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/.browser/smoke.mjs`: newly created ignored diagnostic; next immediate action.\n- `/workspace/frontend/.browser/`: isolated Chromium package/binary/bundled libraries; ignored.\n- `/workspace/frontend/test-results/`: browser failure screenshots/traces and context; ignored.","time":{"start":1794312861370,"end":1794312916815}}}
